        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>第七页</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n  </script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      min-height: 720px;\n      background:\n        radial-gradient(ellipse at 65% 0%, rgba(255,255,255,.25), transparent 34%),\n        repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(44,101,77,.035) 0 1px, transparent 1px 5px),\n        #b8d8bd;\n      color: #1d1b16;\n      font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", \"FangSong\", serif;\n    }\n    .page {\n      width: 510px;\n      height: 696px;\n      margin: 12px auto;\n      position: relative;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      background:\n        linear-gradient(to right, transparent 0 128px, rgba(160,169,126,.28) 128px 129px, transparent 129px),\n        repeating-linear-gradient(to right, rgba(143,143,111,.22) 0 1px, transparent 1px 18px),\n        repeating-linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(143,143,111,.22) 0 1px, transparent 1px 18px),\n        #faf8e7;\n      border-radius: 2px;\n      box-shadow: 0 1px 5px rgba(54,83,57,.15);\n    }\n    .top-strip {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 3px;\n      left: 0;\n      right: 0;\n      height: 40px;\n      border-radius: 23px 23px 0 0;\n      background: rgba(252,250,229,.92);\n    }\n    .header {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 18px;\n      right: 88px;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      letter-spacing: 2px;\n      transform: rotate(-3deg);\n    }\n    .lemon {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 13px;\n      right: 25px;\n      width: 41px;\n      height: 33px;\n      border-radius: 50% 45% 48% 45%;\n      background: #e6d552;\n      opacity: .76;\n      transform: rotate(25deg);\n      box-shadow: inset -5px -4px 0 rgba(188,157,44,.18);\n    }\n    .lemon:after {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      width: 8px;\n      height: 4px;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      background: rgba(136,113,45,.35);\n      top: 10px;\n      left: 15px;\n    }\n    .leaf {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 2px;\n      right: -2px;\n      width: 41px;\n      height: 21px;\n      background: #e5d950;\n      opacity: .62;\n      border-radius: 100% 0 100% 0;\n      transform: rotate(-24deg);\n    }\n    .margin-note {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 91px;\n      left: 0;\n      width: 120px;\n      min-height: 96px;\n      padding: 4px 5px;\n      color: #bd3a3a;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      line-height: 1.38;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(213,69,69,.65);\n      transform: rotate(-1deg);\n    }\n    .margin-label {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 409px;\n      left: 21px;\n      width: 71px;\n      padding: 2px 5px;\n      color: #bd3a3a;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      text-align: center;\n      border: 1px solid #d6c434;\n      transform: rotate(-1deg);\n    }\n    .notes {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 45px;\n      left: 129px;\n      width: 370px;\n      padding: 0 7px 8px 8px;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      line-height: 1.45;\n      letter-spacing: .5px;\n    }\n    .title {\n      margin: 0 0 1px;\n      font-size: 16px;\n      font-weight: normal;\n      line-height: 1.35;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #d8a93b;\n      display: inline-block;\n      transform: rotate(-1deg);\n    }\n    .para {\n      margin: 1px 0 5px;\n    }\n    .line { min-height: 20px; white-space: nowrap; }\n    .indent { padding-left: 13px; }\n    .section {\n      margin-top: 6px;\n      font-size: 16px;\n      font-weight: normal;\n      line-height: 1.4;\n      display: inline-block;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #d8a93b;\n    }\n    .section mark {\n      background: linear-gradient(transparent 22%, rgba(238,218,72,.52) 22% 92%, transparent 92%);\n      color: inherit;\n      padding: 0 2px;\n    }\n    .red-circle {\n      display: inline-block;\n      border: 1.5px solid #c94040;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      padding: 0 2px;\n      line-height: 1.1;\n      color: #b83232;\n      transform: rotate(-14deg);\n    }\n    .red-underline {\n      border-bottom: 1.4px solid #cc4242;\n      padding-bottom: 1px;\n    }\n    .yellow {\n      background: linear-gradient(transparent 28%, rgba(245,224,74,.45) 28% 93%, transparent 93%);\n    }\n    .tiny-red {\n      color: #bc3737;\n      font-size: 12px;\n    }\n    .bottom {\n      margin-top: 4px;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <div class=\"top-strip\"></div>\n    <div class=\"header\">第七页</div>\n    <div class=\"lemon\"></div>\n    <div class=\"leaf\"></div>\n\n    <aside class=\"margin-note\">\n      实践告诉我们，假如你<br>\n      烦，生活是每天的点<br>\n      然，和平是对习惯到<br>\n      人们可享受积极的光<br>\n      是主要最该成的他人上<br>\n      天，才对他人有用。\n    </aside>\n\n    <div class=\"margin-label\">“<span class=\"tiny-red\">变成</span>勇”</div>\n\n    <article class=\"notes\">\n      <h1 class=\"title\">从这一刻起，就能获得幸福</h1>\n\n      <div class=\"para\">\n        <div class=\"line indent\">有人说幸福大部分取决于自己。</div>\n        <div class=\"line indent\">幸福即贡献感。</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">“能是属于为你那里是在有奔头，那事要‘感受’到自</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">己有他人有用，也就是贡献感。</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">“我对他人有用” 这种想法是比他人<span class=\"red-circle\">体</span>会到自己有</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">用。</div>\n        <div class=\"line indent\">获得贡献感的手段一旦成了“被他人认可”，最终就不得</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">不按照他人的愿望来做自己的事。这些以自我牺牲来获</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">得感没有自我。</div>\n        <div class=\"line indent\">即使不靠去寻求他人认可，也可以体验到“我对他人</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">有用”（，主观感觉）</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <h2 class=\"section\"><mark>追求理想者面前的两条路</mark></h2>\n      <div class=\"para\">\n        <div class=\"line indent\">“他越追<span class=\"red-circle\">追</span>求”希望曾梦想追求理想状态，以希望特别优秀</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">而特别优人为关注，朝向好的一定不出向事件中已经感到他</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">人关注，破坏变为，希望特别为益，愿于<span class=\"red-circle\">康</span>你向他越追<span class=\"red-circle\">追</span></div>\n        <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"red-circle\">求</span>。”</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <h2 class=\"section\"><mark>甘于平凡的勇气</mark></h2>\n      <div class=\"para\">\n        <div class=\"line indent\">普通并不等于无能，我们根本没必要背负既满足自己的优越</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">性。</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <h2 class=\"section\"><mark>人生时二道半内剖</mark></h2>\n      <div class=\"para\">\n        <div class=\"line indent\">不幸把人生理解成一条线，都是退缩成熟的迷惑。</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">人生时连续的剎那，我们只能活在“此时此刻”，我们的</div>\n        <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"red-underline\">一生只存在剎那之中。</span></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <h2 class=\"section\"><mark>每次人生</mark></h2>\n      <div class=\"para bottom\">\n        <div class=\"line indent\">努力做了的那一瞬间“旅行”已经开始，朝着目的地出</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">发途中的每一个瞬间都是旅行。如果因某事尚未达到目的</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">地，也并非旅行。</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <h2 class=\"section\"><mark>最重要的是“此时此刻”</mark></h2>\n      <div class=\"para\">\n        <div class=\"line indent\">聚焦“此时此刻”是认真而严谨地做好现在能做的事情。</div>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
